# ==========================================
# 1. Ignore everything by default
# ==========================================
/*

# ==========================================
# 2. Whitelist ONLY Card directories, README & .gitignore
# ==========================================
!.gitignore
!README.md
!skills/
!skills/**
!blueprints/
blueprints/*
!blueprints/cards/
!blueprints/cards/**

# ==========================================
# 3. Environment & Secrets & OS/IDE Safety
# ==========================================
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.token
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.log
